---

<section class="howto" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-badge">Cómo funciona</span>
      <h2>Empieza en 3 pasos</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-card dark">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Descargá la App</h3>
          <p>Gratis en Google Play. Instala en segundos y abrís con tu cuenta.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-connector">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-card blue">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"/><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="4"/><path d="M20.4 18.4L22 20"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Elegí tu Materia</h3>
          <p>Seleccioná la especialidad y nivel de dificultad que quieras practicar.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-connector">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-card green">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>¡Aprendé y Progresá!</h3>
          <p>Respondé preguntas, leé explicaciones y seguí tu progreso en tiempo real.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
